uble of making this redesign as  you can see having like a flat glass  back with protruding glass on the back  and the front like this which is totally  unique then apple might as well redesign  the port i thought that the iphone 14  lineup would be getting this redesign as  you can see we talked about these  different leaks that ross young  confirmed with the dual hole punch  camera as you can see right here and of  course renders by shylesh helped me with  those rumors and man this iphone design  looks sick you got the glass on both the  front and the back circular power  buttons and this actually originated  from john prosser's exclusive leak of  the iphone 14 which happened way back in  september he said that the iphone 14 is  getting a full redesign with these crazy  new design updated speaker grilles  completely flat glass back which  obviously this looks absolutely  beautiful but the interesting thing is  within those renders he kept the  lightning port around and even a couple  months back he said twitter bookmarked  this tweet if the iphone ever gets usbc  i will shave off my eyebrows and then of  course we got a major shift in the leaks  with a lot of leaks of the iphone 14  lineup coming out showing off a similar  design to the iphone 13 that we already  have as you can see the same design as  we have with the iphone 13 lineup but  with larger camera bumps so after that  happened john prosser came out with a  new video saying this is the real iphone  14 finally admitting that it's more  likely that the iphone 14 lineup is  gonna stick to the same ish design as we  already have with the iphone 13 and  within that video he admitted that he  thinks he received his renders and leaks  one year early so he admitted that it's  more likely for that full redesign with  the flush glass back protruding glass on  the front and back to be coming next  year with the iphone 15 lineup so what  all of this means is that this is likely  the design of the iphone 15 pro and 